// Q-1251 `quillo check` passes a link to an address no route answers: `/trail/<id>` beside `route GET /trails/:id(int)` is a 404, found only when someone clicks it
// mode: check
// open-when: Q-1251-check-passes-a-link-to-no-route.qwe: ok
// fixed-when: /trail/
// From FEEDBACK79.md §Q-1251 (found on 238dac2, 0.8.6; open on 68da426, 0.8.8).

route GET / = <ul>{for id in [1, 2] => <li><a href={`/trail/${id}`}>trail {id}</a></li>}</ul>
route GET /trails/:id(int) = `trail ${id}`
